            "notes": "For the 1st round, I prefer [Frags For Days](item_bc48152f-c523-4dc7-afe0-1c016906bc8a) against shield tanks, and [Bango!](item_b48a6731-fae8-4732-aae0-ceffbf324235) for Zarya/Orisa/D.Va.\n\n\"Frags For Days\" has more raw damage, with each bonus frag doing 42 dmg. \"Bango!\" is good for doing added damage in the limited hits you get between Bubbles/Javelin Spin/Defense Matrix, but it only does 25 additional dmg, and only on no-bounce directs.",
