            "notes": "By this round, you absolutely must get [Zip Grease](item_f1f004d4-d091-42e9-b34e-2b12f56e82c6). It's Junkrat's greatest tool against all of the high mobility and distant sniper heroes in Stadium. \n\nRegularly, you will be using a conc mine to head towards the fight or to give space between you and a hero diving you, which makes your next two shots act almost like hitscan shots. The only time you don't want to use a conc mine for mobility is when the fight is brawling and you don't need a better position. Toss the conc mine into the fray to get those fast-flying frags! If you manage to launch someone up, they're a sitting duck for your boosted shots.\n\n---\n\nThe general strategy for Powers is to pick up whichever you didn't take during Round 1 ([Frags For Days](item_bc48152f-c523-4dc7-afe0-1c016906bc8a) or [Bango!](item_b48a6731-fae8-4732-aae0-ceffbf324235))\n\nIn rare cases, when your team is really struggling, consider [Soot Shaker](item_365d55fe-06c9-4600-8369-5f00bd0c5b19) as a way to bolster your [Zip Grease](item_f1f004d4-d091-42e9-b34e-2b12f56e82c6) shots. It will generally be your Round 5 pick.",
