            "notes": "Your next purple item will be [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), so you're working towards that while trying to keep your [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016).\n\nDepending on your cash, you could scrap [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) for [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) or just add [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) with a couple greens and get \"Phantasmic Flux\" next round.",
