            "created_at": "2025-09-25T03:44:23.491368+00:00",
            "notes": "Get whichever power you didn't select from Round 5. \n\nIn rare instances, you can consider [Double Trouble](item_850f4701-cb41-4083-ba0e-7f96b6757025) or [Slapnel](item_960e424b-3533-46b1-8063-11b575225647) when dealing with heroes like D.Va//Orisa as a means to do something while they Defense Matrix/Javelin Spin your other projectiles, and \"Slapnel\" is great as a 3rd conc mine to give you more space. The added survivability could be needed instead of [Bingo!](item_1234b16b-1426-4a0c-b6c3-213180336cc6)/[Soot Shaker](item_365d55fe-06c9-4600-8369-5f00bd0c5b19).\n\nAs for items, top yourself off with the best you can get and good luck!",
